### =====================================================================
### Project requests - open this file in the editor and click "Send Request"
###
### VS Code    : install the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client),
###              then a "Send Request" link appears above each ### block
### IntelliJ   : built-in HTTP Client, a green arrow appears in the gutter
###
### Nothing to install on the server side, and no cmd involved.
### =====================================================================

@quiz     = http://127.0.0.1:8090
@question = http://127.0.0.1:8081
@gateway  = http://127.0.0.1:8765


### ---------------------------------------------------------------- 1
### Circuit breaker state. Watch: state, bufferedCalls, failedCalls,
### notPermittedCalls. This is the request to re-send during the demo.
GET {{quiz}}/actuator/circuitbreakers


### ---------------------------------------------------------------- 2
### State transition log - CLOSED -> OPEN -> HALF_OPEN -> CLOSED,
### each with a timestamp.
GET {{quiz}}/actuator/circuitbreakerevents


### ---------------------------------------------------------------- 3
### Create a quiz, straight to quiz-service.
### question-service up   -> 201 Created
### question-service down -> 503 from the fallback (once createQuiz checks it)
POST {{quiz}}/quiz/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "java",
  "numQ": 2,
  "title": "Spring Quiz"
}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------- 4
### Same call through the API gateway.
### The service id must be LOWERCASE: lower-case-service-id is true in
### api-gateway/application.yaml, so /QUIZ-SERVICE/... returns 404.
POST {{gateway}}/quiz-service/quiz/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "java",
  "numQ": 2,
  "title": "Spring Quiz"
}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------- 5
### question-service directly, to prove whether it is up.
### Refused here = the breaker is about to start counting failures.
GET {{question}}/question/allQuestions


### ---------------------------------------------------------------- 6
### Health. With register-health-indicator on, the circuitBreakers
### component shows up here too.
GET {{quiz}}/actuator/health


### ---------------------------------------------------------------- 7
### Eureka registry as JSON - which instances are registered right now.
GET http://127.0.0.1:8761/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json
